    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Principle 19. culture"
    },
    {
      "type": "sentences",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "239",
          "text": "Our culture is different from other cultures."
        },
        {
          "n": "240",
          "text": "Especially our language and life style are not like any other country's."
        },
        {
          "n": "241",
          "text": "Korean culture is very unique."
        },
        {
          "n": "242",
          "text": "My family celebrates Chuseok and New Year's Day wearing the Hanbok,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "our traditional clothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "sentences",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "243",
          "text": "I like Hanboks because they are so beautiful."
        },
        {
          "n": "244",
          "text": "Traditional Korean meals include boiled rice, soup, fish or meat"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "and several vegetable side dishes."
    },
    {
      "type": "sentences",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "245",
          "text": "Bulgogi is the most popular Korean meat dish."
        },
        {
          "n": "246",
          "text": "The most popular vegetable dish is kimchi."
        },
        {
          "n": "247",
          "text": "I like them both."
        },
        {
          "n": "248",
          "text": "In 1420, the King Sejong asked scholars to invent a unique,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Korean alphabet."
    },
    {
      "type": "sentences",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "249",
          "text": "I'm proud of my country and my culture."
        }
      ]
    },
